# Backend Project Overview

NestJS 10 + TypeScript monorepo (pnpm 9, Turborepo, Node >=20.19).

Layout:
- `gateway/` — REST edge, auth guards, proxy, OpenAPI
- `ws-gateway/` — Socket.IO realtime
- `services/*` — domain microservices
- `workers/*` — RabbitMQ consumers
- `libs/*` — shared platform code (`@nestlancer/*`)
- `prisma/` — modular schemas, migrations, seeds

Always use workspace package imports (`@nestlancer/...`), never deep relative paths across packages.

Before claiming done on non-trivial changes, run the relevant gates:
- `pnpm lint`
- `pnpm build` (acts as typecheck; no separate typecheck script)
- `pnpm test:unit` for package logic; add integration/e2e when touching HTTP, DB, queues, or auth
- `pnpm contract:check` when OpenAPI/controllers/DTOs change

Do not hand-edit generated outputs: `**/dist/**`, `prisma/generated/**`, `docs/api/openapi-merged.json`, `docker-compose.prod.yml`, generated k3s workloads.
